OL,3,GNEWSAI want to know if a flooded mine
OL,4,Awill leave my home underwater again
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK and Welsh governments said there
OL,7,Fwas no "national assessment" of risks
OL,8,Fposed by flooded mines but both added
OL,9,Fthey're working to reduce the "risk" of
OL,10,Fflooding.
